JavaScript Cebu brand assets

The JavaScript Cebu name, the hexagon logo in every version (SVG, PNG and the
source PSD), the wordmark lockups and the sticker are © JavaScript Cebu. They
are not covered by the MIT license at the root of this repository.

You may use them to make things for or about JavaScript Cebu (event graphics,
recaps, sponsor walls, talks, community pages) as described at
https://www.jscebu.org/brand. Don't alter the logo, and don't use it in a way
that suggests JavaScript Cebu endorses something it doesn't.

The code in this package (generators, scripts, templates) is MIT-licensed like
the rest of the repository. Fonts keep their own licenses (SIL Open Font
License or Apache 2.0).
